<title>USA: AMARILLO FEEDER CATTLE PRICES STEADY-$2 LOWER-USDA.</title>
<headline>AMARILLO FEEDER CATTLE PRICES STEADY-$2 LOWER-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder Steers and heifers were steady to $2.00 per cwt lower, compared to last week, USDA said.  Bulk supply Medium and Large 1-2 400-900 lb feeder steers and 300-800 lb heifers. Trade and demand moderate.</p>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers under 600 lbs 61 percent, over 600 lbs 36 percent with 3 percent cows and bulls.</p>
<p>Receipts - 2,608    Week Ago - 2,283    Year Ago - 2,087</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 78.50-82.50; 700-800 lbs 77.25-79.00; 800-900 lbs 73.50-77.00. Medium and Large 1-2 - 600-700 lbs 77.50-81.00; pkg 761 lbs 77.75. Small and Medium 1-2 - 500-600 lbs 75.00-79.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 76.00-80.00; 700-800 lbs 75.25-76.50; 800-900 lbs 65.50-69.50. Medium and Large 1-2 - 600-700 lbs 72.00-76.50; two pkgs 713-715 lbs 67.00-74.50.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
